  <h2 id="what-it-is">What it is</h2>
  <p>
    LaVioLab Atlas is a set of instructions, called skills, for Claude Code, ChatGPT and Codex:
    <code>start</code>, <code>content-plan</code> and <code>report</code>. It has no server and no
    account. It is free and its source code is open under the
    <a href="https://github.com/Smolevich/pet-project-atlas/blob/main/plugin/LICENSE">MIT licence</a>.
  </p>

