    warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose and non-infringement. To the extent
    the MIT licence allows, the author is not liable for any claim, damages or other liability arising
    from the plugin or its use.
  </p>

  <h2 id="results">Results are recommendations</h2>
  <p>
    What the skills return are recommendations built from the reports and exports you give them. They
    are not a promise of positions in search or in AI answers, of traffic or of revenue. Check a
    recommendation before you act on it.
  </p>

  <h2 id="your-responsibility">Your data and your site</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      You are responsible for the data and exports you upload or paste into a chat, and for having the
      right to share them.
    </li>
    <li>You are responsible for the changes you make to your own site and for their consequences.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    The plugin itself collects no data. See <a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a>.
  </p>

  <h2 id="third-party">Third-party services</h2>
  <p>
    The plugin runs inside services it does not control: ChatGPT (OpenAI), Claude and Claude Code
    (Anthropic), Codex (OpenAI), and Google Search Console when you use its exports or API. Each one is
    governed by its own terms and privacy policy.
  </p>

  <h2 id="changes">Changes</h2>
